+# Plan: JSON Pointer Resolution
+Spec: [spec.md](spec.md). Standard: RFC 6901 §3, §4, §5.
+
+## Design
+- `src/pointer.ts`: `PointerError extends Error`, `resolvePointer(document: unknown, pointer: string): unknown`. Re-exported from `src/index.ts` (`.js` import extension).
+- Algorithm: `""` → document; must start with `/`; split on `/`, drop first; decode each token (reject `~` not followed by 0/1; replace `~1` then `~0`); walk: arrays by `/^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$/` index < length; objects by `Object.hasOwn`; otherwise throw.
+- Dev deps: typescript + @types/node for type-check; tests run on compiled output? Node has no TS runner assumed, so tests are `.test.js`-free: see tasks.
+
+## Constitution Check
+- I: standard/sections named. II: no `dependencies`. III: tests first, failing first. IV: read-only, own-property lookup. V: strict TS, doc comments, exported. VI: one small file.
